<#job/owner-graph-index> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/raf/report/1#summary> "One RDF writer puts and deletes every rdf:g graph declaration together with its rdf:o owner-to-graph mirror in the same batch. One online migration, fenced and seeded at open and paged by the maintenance worker, builds the mirror from existing declaration keys in resumable pages behind the owner-graph writer families, covering privately prepared graphs. Scoped views enumerate graphs from the mirror, plus, while the migration is unfinished, the declarations past its frontier filtered to the view's owners (uncharged to the request budget, with cancellation), and merge graph-leading twins of the store-wide plan through the one ScopedRows heap." .
<#job/owner-graph-index> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/raf/report/1#vectorPath> "crates/sparrow-core/src/storage/rdf_index.rs" .
